{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/77c43f27a860d4a5f6f5f4457347bb15.avif?t=1759136347\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/cd76316be091e07728fb09892ad37b41.poster.avif?t=1759136347\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/cd76316be091e07728fb09892ad37b41.webm?t=1759136347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/cd76316be091e07728fb09892ad37b41.mp4?t=1759136347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't let the sweets get outside the dome. Merge them together, and make the biggest candy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're about to dive into a sugary adventure! Combine sweets, and prepare yourself for a sugar overload! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather extraordinary powers that can save you from any sticky situation. Mix them up, and you might create something even more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through worlds full of surprises. Each has its own set of challenges. Can you master them all and merge the largest sweet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/07d51cf2d23a3654a6d96ae897ba8a17.avif?t=1759136347\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/fa0e0ff3488da166ff71bc8d319bd6ca.poster.avif?t=1759136347\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/fa0e0ff3488da166ff71bc8d319bd6ca.webm?t=1759136347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/fa0e0ff3488da166ff71bc8d319bd6ca.mp4?t=1759136347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards to show off your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Co-op mode for you and your friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 maps with crazy mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Awesome, game-changing power-ups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully customizable name and character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An adorably sweet aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweeten your day with a new high score!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sweet Tooth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3325860/f7532b61db9472629f51250f6ae7cc7c8d50862f.jpg"},{"name":"Chocolate Addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3325860/f9128c9fa888dab04ce30a9d91f5735c23b79325.jpg"},{"name":"Sugar Overdose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3325860/c4dbf289c0778ca08ea69ee30873585d8cc5342b.jpg"},{"name":"Glucose Cultist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3325860/e12f04608b6e30e7087cb7926c980329d0ea76ae.jpg"},{"name":"Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3325860/e9d96fa6a5243a80e6420847820fc5d5d0996134.jpg"},{"name":"Geologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea